{"code":"YL09","wikidata":"Q119722811","wikipedia":{"en":"Yaek Lam Sali MRT station","th":"สถานีแยกลำสาลี"},"summary":{"en":"Yaek Lam Sali station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Yellow Line. The station is located on Srinagarindra Road in Bang Kapi District, Bangkok and is named after Lam Sali Intersection where the Srinagarindra and Ramkhamhaeng roads intersect adjacent to the station. The station has four entrances.","th":"สถานีแยกลำสาลี เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีเหลือง โดยยกระดับเหนือถนนศรีนครินทร์ในพื้นที่เขตบางกะปิ กรุงเทพมหานคร เป็นจุดเชื่อมต่อสถานีรถไฟฟ้าในเส้นทางรถไฟฟ้ามหานคร สายสีส้ม และสายสีน้ำตาลในอนาคต"},"opened":"2023-06-12","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Yaek_Lam_Sali_Station_09.jpg/960px-Yaek_Lam_Sali_Station_09.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yaek_Lam_Sali_Station_09.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/Yaek_Lam_Sali_Station_01.jpg/960px-Yaek_Lam_Sali_Station_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yaek_Lam_Sali_Station_01.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Yaek_Lam_Sali_Station_02.jpg/960px-Yaek_Lam_Sali_Station_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yaek_Lam_Sali_Station_02.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/02/Yaek_Lam_Sali_Station_03.jpg/960px-Yaek_Lam_Sali_Station_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yaek_Lam_Sali_Station_03.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC